00:01:05.393 --> 00:01:06.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh my gosh!

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.320 line:92%
- I was like, what happened?!

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.410 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughing)

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:12.840 line:92%
- You are so fancy right now.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.050 line:92%
- [Fortune] Yeah I had to wear a white wedding gown.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.180 line:92%
- [Kelly] Oh my god, you were from the bricks.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.013 size:81% position:41% line:92%
