00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.727 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It happens.

00:01:26.727 --> 00:01:27.738 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- It happens.

00:01:27.738 --> 00:01:29.797 line:92%
