00:01:40.862 --> 00:01:41.804 line:92%
- That's amazing. - [Norman] Etiquette classes?

00:01:41.804 --> 00:01:43.854 line:92%
- Yeah I had to learn how to be a lady.

00:01:43.854 --> 00:01:46.414 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:01:46.414 --> 00:01:48.404 line:92%
No I didn't know, I didn't know.

00:01:48.404 --> 00:01:49.447 line:92%
