00:01:55.517 --> 00:01:57.270 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.470 line:92%
- Obviously I didn't attend etiquette class.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.150 line:92%
