00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.327 size:81% position:41% line:92%
'cause it's not great.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.420 line:92%
- So what did your family think whenever

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.250 line:92%
you told them you were gay? 'Cause being from the south

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.120 line:92%
that is not always an easy conversation.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.040 line:92%
- Yeah, I mean I think my mom for her

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:18.050 line:92%
she just, she didn't want my life to be harder

00:02:18.932 --> 00:02:21.970 line:92%
than what life can be. - Already.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.060 line:92%
- Already but we had this really poignant moment,

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.010 line:92%
I talk about it in my special

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.270 line:92%
where I told her I was gay and she was stone faced

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:33.023 line:92%
and I was like oh man, does she hate me now?

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:38.262 line:92%
She was like, we are goin' to Hooters!

00:02:38.262 --> 00:02:41.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I was like what!

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.300 line:92%
So that was her way of being,

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.734 line:92%
I accept you, let's go to Hooters.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.150 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:52.400 line:92%
And then when I told my dad,

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.400 line:92%
he was like, he's very typical southern man

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.443 line:92%
that's very simple and he's like, okay.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:04.360 line:92%
All right, well you wants us to buy you a men's blazer?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.242 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:03:07.242 --> 00:03:09.231 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Or a top hat?

00:03:09.231 --> 00:03:12.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.460 line:92%
Lesbians don't wear top hats.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
