00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:16.650 line:92%
In his mind, like if women like women

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:17.910 line:92%
you wanna dress like a man.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.043 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- For sure.

00:03:19.043 --> 00:03:21.843 line:92%
He was like, okay let's get you that top hat and blazer.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.430 line:92%
- That's kind of amazing though.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.960 line:92%
Being from the south that they were accepting

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.360 line:92%
'cause I know a lot, I have a lot of friends actually,

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:30.970 line:92%
or few friends that they didn't say let's go to Hooters

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.140 line:92%
they said let's go to church

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.800 line:92%
and they wanted to pray for 'em and like

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.390 line:92%
change 'em straight or something

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:37.550 line:92%
and I'm like, I don't think your prayers gonna

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.419 line:92%
make 'em straight, just sayin'.

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.030 line:92%
Yeah so it can be hard for people.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.560 line:92%
- A hundred percent, I mean

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.320 line:92%
