00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.520 line:92%
and I'm so lucky that my family--

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.353 line:92%
- [Kelly] Your parents, they're awesome.

00:03:51.353 --> 00:03:53.480 line:92%
- Yeah they were just like, we love you no matter what.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.610 line:92%
You are no different than you were yesterday.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:57.988 line:92%
And I mean, yeah. - That's so good.

00:03:57.988 --> 00:03:58.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's so good.

